Z||000003||DXR_DAD||04-10-2000||09:05 PM||||Thats why you buy a parts car for $400.00.<BR>I'm looking at a 85 GT  it's under about 4ft of whatever?? looks like it's been sitting for years, junk all inside, engine half apart, The car is JUNK! body parts good.<BR>I told the guy to give me $50.00 and I'll take it away?  <P>Thats how this Fiero thing is done,. Some people have time to bone yard hop and get good deals, that also works. I have parts now that I dont need, the price was right of free<BR>I don't need them now,.....key work, NOW<P>If Fiero Shop is selling them for $50.00 that tells me someone is selling them for less.<BR>Fiero Shop is right, when do you want it!, how bad do you want it, and what condition do you want it.<P>Just my 0.02 ||||reg||5
